<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Get help with ThemeBuilder. Contact support or browse product documentation.">
  <title>ThemeBuilder Support</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/support-site.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("partials/site-header", { activePage: "home" }) %>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> THEMEBUILDER HELP CENTER</span>
        <h1>How can we<br><span>help you today?</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Find your way around ThemeBuilder, get answers, or reach out to our support team. We’re here to help you move forward.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/documentation">Explore documentation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="mailto:haseebharry07@gmail.com">Email support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="orbit-core"><span>T</span></div>
        <div class="orbit-tag tag-one">Design</div>
        <div class="orbit-tag tag-two">Build</div>
        <div class="orbit-tag tag-three">Launch</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section quick-help">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">START HERE</span>
        <h2>Find the right kind of help</h2>
        <p>Choose a resource to get started, or send us a message if you need a person.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-grid">
        <a class="resource-card" href="/documentation">
          <span class="card-icon icon-violet" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>
          <span class="card-kicker">LEARN</span>
          <h3>Documentation</h3>
          <p>Get familiar with ThemeBuilder and find practical guidance for common tasks.</p>
          <span class="card-link">Read the guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-card" href="mailto:haseebharry07@gmail.com">
          <span class="card-icon icon-mint" aria-hidden="true">✉</span>
          <span class="card-kicker">TALK TO US</span>
          <h3>Contact support</h3>
          <p>Tell us what you’re working on and where you’re stuck. We’ll help you find a next step.</p>
          <span class="card-link">Send an email <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-card" href="/privacy">
          <span class="card-icon icon-amber" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
          <span class="card-kicker">YOUR INFORMATION</span>
          <h3>Privacy &amp; terms</h3>
          <p>Review the information about using the service and how personal information is handled.</p>
          <span class="card-link">View policies <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-banner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">REAL PEOPLE, HERE TO HELP</span>
        <h2>Still have a question?</h2>
        <p>Send us an email and include a brief description of what you need help with.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-light" href="mailto:haseebharry07@gmail.com">haseebharry07@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("partials/site-footer") %>
</body>
</html>
